

>> usedMemory1 := 0.
>> usedMemory2 := 0.
>> usedMemory3 := 0.
>> usedMemory4 := 0.

Lenaneo taolo-ea-mohopolo: 0.

{ :i Sephetho ngola: i. } × 4.
Sephetho mola-o-mocha.
{ :i Sephetho ngola: (4 - i). } × 4.
Sephetho mola-o-mocha.
( 1 > 2 ) leshano: { Sephetho ngola: ['BLOCK 1'], mola-o-mocha. }.
( 2 > 1 ) nnete:  { Sephetho ngola: ['BLOCK 2'], mola-o-mocha. }.

>> i := 0.
{ Sephetho ngola: i. i eketsa: 1. } ha-feela: { <- ( i < 3). }.
Sephetho mola-o-mocha.

i := 3.
{ Sephetho ngola: i. i := i - 1. } ha-feela: { <- ( i > 0). }.
Sephetho mola-o-mocha.


Lenaneo hloekisa.

usedMemory1 := (Lenaneo mohopolo ? 0).


{ :i  Sephetho ngola: i. } × 4.
Sephetho mola-o-mocha.
{ :i  Sephetho ngola: (4 - i). } × 4.
Sephetho mola-o-mocha.
( 1 > 2 ) leshano: { Sephetho ngola: ['BLOCK 1'], mola-o-mocha. }.
